        while ((line = in.readLine()) != null) {
            if (line.charAt(0) == '+') {
                peopleSet.add(line.substring(1));
            } else if (line.charAt(0) == '-') {
                peopleSet.remove(line.substring(1));
            } else {
                int index = line.indexOf(':');
                if (index != -1) {
                    total += peopleSet.size() * (line.length() - (index + 1));
                }
            }
        }
        System.out.println(total);
    }
}
```

This optimized code still has the same time and space complexity as the original code, but it is slightly more efficient because it avoids the unnecessary conversion of the input line to a character array.
